1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:04,020
(Raj:)And yes, that time,
I meant it to be dirty.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:07,750
(Sheldon:)Really?

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,390
(Sheldon:)Leonard wants me back?

4
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:12,530
(Penny:)Oh, yes. He says they
are lost without you.

5
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:16,200
(Sheldon:)Well, we sure saw that coming.

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,650
(Penny:)That's right.

7
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:18,930
(Raj:)You know what
I'm going to do?

8
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:22,440
(Sheldon:)I am going to sit here
and just let them stew.

9
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:27,410
(Penny:)No, no, no. You know,

10
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,040
(Penny:)they have
suffered enough.

11
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,510
(Penny:)Everybody's
suffered enough.

12
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:34,680
(Penny:)The thing is, you're going
to have to offer him

13
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:36,720
(Penny:)a face-saving
way out of this.

14
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:37,880
(Sheldon:)How?

15
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:39,090
(Penny:)Say you're sorry.

16
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:40,720
(Sheldon:)Oh, no.

17
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:44,220
(Sheldon:)Mrs. Mary Cooper
didn't raise her no liars.

18
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:47,330
(Penny:)Okay. Um...

19
00:00:47,330 --> 00:00:49,130
(Penny:)How about this? You know
how you're always trying

20
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:50,330
(Penny:)to learn about sarcasm?

21
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:52,100
(Howard:)No.
No?

22
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,770
(Sheldon:)I was being sarcastic.

23
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:57,100
(Penny:)Oh. Good for you.

24
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,510
(Penny:)So all you have to do here
is say you're sorry to Leonard,

25
00:00:59,510 --> 00:01:01,240
(Penny:)but say it
sarcastically.

